  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Outside on the street, Ivan Samsonov gets into a heated physical fight. His distressed wife Nina rushes out to pull him away, escorting him back into the apartment where their curious son Misha asks what happened. Let's listen to the family argument in Russian first; don't worry if you don't catch every word right away.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ваня, ты в полном порядке?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Да, всё нормально, не волнуйся.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Прекратите эту драку прямо сейчас!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Пойдём скорее домой, пожалуйста.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Хорошо, успокойся, пойдём скорее.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "misha",
   "t": "Мама, что там на улице случилось?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Твой папа снова сильно подрался.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "misha",
   "t": "Папа, тебя кто-то побил?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Никто меня не побил, сынок.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я просто защищал нашу честь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ваня, тебе нельзя драться на улице!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ты ведь будущий мэр города!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Ты права, я же кандидат!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Тогда веди себя спокойно, Ваня.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Now let's walk through the street brawl aftermath line by line.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ваня, ты в полном порядке?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Vanya, are you completely alright?' Nina asks her husband anxiously after the physical confrontation.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Да, всё нормально, не волнуйся.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Yes, everything is fine, don't worry.' Samsonov attempts to downplay his bruises with a reassurance.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Прекратите эту драку прямо сейчас!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Stop this fight right now!' Nina demands an end to the brawl using an imperative phrase.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Пойдём скорее домой, пожалуйста.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Let's go home quickly, please.' Nina urges her husband to leave the street before spectators gather.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Хорошо, успокойся, пойдём скорее.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Fine, calm down, let's go quickly.' Samsonov relents and agrees to walk back inside.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "misha",
   "t": "Мама, что там на улице случилось?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Mom, what happened out there on the street?' Young Misha asks about the commotion outside.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Твой папа снова сильно подрался.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Your dad had a big fight again.' Nina explains the fight to her son with a reflexive past verb.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "misha",
   "t": "Папа, тебя кто-то побил?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Dad, did someone beat you up?' Misha questions his father with genuine childlike concern.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Никто меня не побил, сынок.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Nobody beat me up, son.' Samsonov defends his pride with a negative pronoun construction.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я просто защищал нашу честь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I was simply defending our honor.' Samsonov justifies his aggressive behavior as domestic duty.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ваня, тебе нельзя драться на улице!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Vanya, you must not fight on the street!' Nina scolds him with an impersonal negative modal structure.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ты ведь будущий мэр города!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You are the future mayor of the city after all!' Nina reminds him of his political ambitions.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Ты права, я же кандидат!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You are right, I am a candidate after all!' Samsonov proudly acknowledges his civic status.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Тогда веди себя спокойно, Ваня.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
